      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "Wehypothesized that a restricted fluid resuscitation strategy using <30 × 3 IV crystalloids, would not significantly affect in-hospital mortality, compared to adherence to the 30 × 3 SSCB recommendation in patients with a history of HF.",
      "reason": "The synthesis groups are defined as restricted (<30 × 3 IV crystalloids) versus adherence to the 30 × 3 SSCB recommendation."
